            expression (stdlib/condition.mli[146,6609+0]..[149,6818+51])
              Pexp_constant PConst_string("[create()] creates and returns a new condition variable.\n   This condition variable should be associated (in the programmer's mind)\n   with a certain mutex [m] and with a certain property {i P} of the data\n   structure that is protected by the mutex [m]. ",(stdlib/condition.mli[146,6609+0]..[149,6818+51]),None)
