              Pexp_constant PConst_string("[broadcast c] wakes up all threads waiting on the condition\n   variable [c]. If there are none, this call has no effect.\n\n   It is recommended to call [broadcast c] inside a critical section,\n   that is, while the mutex [m] associated with [c] is locked. ",(stdlib/condition.mli[172,7909+0]..[176,8104+65]),None)
